{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-ii", "title": "盡心下", "description": "孟子曰：「不仁哉，梁惠王也！仁者以其所愛及其所不愛，不仁者以其所不愛及其所愛。」\n公孫丑問曰：「何謂也？」\n「梁惠王以土地之故，糜爛其民而戰之，大敗，將復之，恐不能勝，故驅其所愛子弟以殉之，是之謂以其所不愛及其所愛也。」\n孟子曰：「《春秋》無義戰。彼善於此，則有之矣。征者上伐下也，敵國不相征也。」\n孟子曰：「盡信《書》", "occurrences": 3, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "上", "id": "上"}, {"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "世", "id": "世"}, {"form": "中", "id": "中"}, {"form": "亂", "id": "亂"}, {"form": "伐", "id": "伐"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "周", "id": "周"}, {"form": "征", "id": "征"}, {"form": "德", "id": "德"}, {"form": "恐", "id": "恐"}, {"form": "殺", "id": "殺"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.505525936990736, "source": "征", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 1.589235205116581, "source": "征", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.793208009442517, "source": "征", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 3.1986731175506815, "source": "禮", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 2.2823823856765264, "source": "禮", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 2.505525936990736, "source": "禮", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 2.793208009442517, "source": "禮", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.1986731175506815, "source": "禮", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 3.4863551900024623, "source": "禮", "target": "周"}, {"weight": 2.6390573296152584, "source": "禮", "target": "德"}, {"weight": 2.793208009442517, "source": "禮", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.6878474937846906, "source": "下", "target": "上"}, {"weight": 1.8769172775683618, "source": "下", "target": "伐"}, {"weight": 0.8960880245566357, "source": "下", "target": "亂"}, {"weight": 1.1837700970084166, "source": "下", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.0296194171811581, "source": "下", "target": "世"}, {"weight": 1.589235205116581, "source": "下", "target": "中"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "周", "target": "殺"}, {"weight": 2.2335922215070942, "source": "周", "